WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Most competitive reports begin with the competitors you already know.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.640
Evidence Axis begins by testing whether that list is complete.

3
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:13.153
We scan the market, identify relevant competitors, open the underlying sources,

4
00:00:13.153 --> 00:00:17.256
and verify every material claim before it enters the work.

5
00:00:17.256 --> 00:00:23.000
The evidence is then organized around the decision your team may need to make.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.643
AI can produce a fast and convincing summary.

7
00:00:26.643 --> 00:00:33.018
It can also blend vendor claims, search snippets and inference into one confident answer.

8
00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:37.117
Evidence Axis uses AI to accelerate discovery and comparison,

9
00:00:37.117 --> 00:00:40.760
but human verification controls what becomes a conclusion.

10
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.070
Facts remain separate from analysis.

11
00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:44.456
Unknowns remain visible.

12
00:00:44.456 --> 00:00:50.000
Contradictions are disclosed instead of being removed to create a cleaner story.

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.702
A verified company employee can request a Complimentary Competitive Intelligence Brief built around their own company.

14
00:00:56.702 --> 00:01:02.148
It includes a Competitive Set Scan, an Executive Intelligence Deck, an Evidence Appendix,

15
00:01:02.148 --> 00:01:05.080
and a source register with review dates.

16
00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.745
This is not a reduced teaser or a generic template.

17
00:01:08.745 --> 00:01:14.243
It is defensible, company-specific work that could reasonably be sold as a paid research product.

18
00:01:14.243 --> 00:01:20.840
Evidence Axis provides it at no cost so the client can judge the quality before starting an engagement.

19
00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:27.749
When the evidence raises a live business decision, the work can continue through a Competitive Decision Sprint,

20
00:01:27.749 --> 00:01:31.000
a Competitive Response Sprint, or ongoing Competitive Radar.

21
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.800
Paid engagements are scoped around the decision, evidence depth and work required,

22
00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:41.000
so pricing remains flexible rather than forcing every client into the same package.

23
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.239
Start with the evidence on your company.

24
00:01:44.239 --> 00:01:47.016
Request your Complimentary Competitive Intelligence Brief.
